                <head>206. Minutes of a Senior Interdepartmental Group-International Economic Policy
                        Meeting<anchor n="1" xml:id="d206-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1983-01-12T16:00:00-05:00">January 12, 1983,
